OL,3,GNEWSAFirms fined after radioactive
OL,4,Aspill at nuclear site
OL,5,
OL,6,FSerious safety failings at a Cheshire
OL,7,Fnuclear site contributed to a spill of
OL,8,Fradioactive uranium oxide, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FA metal container filled with
OL,12,Fradioactive powder and weighing at
OL,13,Fleast 11 tonnes fell from a forklift
OL,14,Ftruck at Urenco ChemPlants Ltd's (UCP)
OL,15,Fsite in Capenhurst in February 2024,
OL,16,Fspilling at least 3.3kg (7.3lb) of the
OL,17,Fsubstance.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1795764336
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFirms fined after radioactive
OL,4,Aspill at nuclear site
OL,5,
OL,6,FUCP and contractor Babcock Critical
OL,7,FServices Ltd pleaded guilty to failing
OL,8,Fto ensure the health and safety of
OL,9,Ftheir employees and were fined #50,000
OL,10,Fand #90,000 respectively.
OL,12,FSouth Sefton Magistrates' Court heard
OL,13,Fthat while no-one was harmed, there was
OL,14,Fevidence of poor safety practices at
OL,15,Fthe site and staff were not properly
OL,16,Fequipped to deal with such incidents.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
